Port LoopAlgorithmToPython to the HealthKit-free LoopAlgorithm API.

Upstream LoopAlgorithm removed its HealthKit dependency; HKQuantity/HKUnit are
replaced by LoopQuantity/LoopUnit. Units are mapped to LoopUnit cases directly
rather than via LoopUnit(from:), which silently falls back to .gram for unknown
strings. Also guards the NSException handler, which only exists on Darwin.

